WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.750
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.010
Episode 18

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.010
Huge Battle on the Savanna!

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:54.510
It's called Nature Continent. It's similar to home. So there's a place like this in this world.

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:00.550
Radar! Radar!! Radar!!!

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.970
He's here!

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.400
I found you, Sonic! Finish him! Decoe, Bocoe!

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.520
Okay.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:28.040
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.250
I'm going to play for a while.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.080
What are you going to do, Sonic?

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.600
Sonic is coming at us!

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.770
Shoot him down!

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.560
We won't make it in time!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.320
What?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.490
We're going to crash!

00:02:58.490 --> 00:02:59.780
He did it!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.870
Whoa!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.330
Oh no!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.380
Tails!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.140
Okay.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.810
I finished the repairs.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.980
Okay? But what about the wings?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.730
It can't fly, but...

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.860
It can walk on the ground.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.160
I see. We're going to travel using Cyclone.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.210
That's no good.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.760
Can I help with anything?

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.970
Thanks, but I'm fine.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.220
I see.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.600
There are no stores around here.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.740
I can't use my cell phone either.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.340
If you're sleepy, then go ahead and sleep.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.180
I'll wake you up when I'm done with the repairs.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.390
I'm not-

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.390
Don't worry about me.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:55.060
Really? It's so different from the city that I feel like relaxing.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.310
Really?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.110
Time feels like it's moving slowly.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.110
Tails, you like the city better, right?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:07.320
That's not true. My world is similar to here, so I feel more comfortable.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.830
I didn't expect you to say that.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:18.080
I'm thinking about finding a place like this near Station Square and having my own workshop there.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:19.540
I see.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.260
I hope your dream comes true, Tails.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:27.180
Yeah. How about you, Chris? What's your dream?

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:32.310
Recently, I've been thinking of becoming a zoologist.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:40.690
Grandpa and Father are both totally into robots, but I like animals more than robots.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.940
When I said animals, I didn't mean you guys!

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:48.410
I finished. This time, the repairs are complete.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.120
Let's go find Sonic.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.840
How dare that Sonic!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.350
Crocodiles!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:28.320
They're so rude! I have an IQ of 300. I won't let you eat my brain.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.300
Stop pounding your chest!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.590
Stop it!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.850
Dr. Eggman.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:56.560
We're going to search for Sonic.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.850
I'm counting on you.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.440
E-65, let's go.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.740
This feels way better than the city!

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:28.550
But where did Tails and Chris go?

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.050
Hey!

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.620
<i>"if you wish to surpass me, try to surpass the speed of sound"</i>

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.720
You want to race me?

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:46.520
You're the fastest creature I've met in this world so far.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.820
But you're still no match for me. Here we go!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:06.090
He became the first cheetah to run at supersonic speed.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.430
What's this? What are they building?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.270
I don't know.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.230
You over there! Stop loafing around!

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.020
Hurry! The delivery date is approaching!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.610
I want this finished as soon as possible so that I can leave.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.410
What are you building?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.830
What are we building? Can't you tell?

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.080
A dam. We're building a dam.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:42.830
A dam?

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.000
What's a dam?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:48.590
It's a levee that holds back water from rivers and valleys.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.800
Rivers and valleys?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.380
There's nothing like that around here.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:55.630
You're right.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.350
Why are you making a dam here?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.770
Adults have their reasons that children cannot understand.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:12.440
But if you make a dam here, what happens to the animals that live here?

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.450
That's not our problem.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.320
They're interfering with our construction.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.320
Get them out of here!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.160
Sorry.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.040
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.170
We don't have time to waste on you.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.460
C'mon, let's go.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.890
Everyone, are you fine with this?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.180
Are you really fine with this?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.390
Tails...

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.360
Long time ago, I also...

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.820
Stop it!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.490
Please don't break it!

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.840
He's cool!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.840
I'm going to follow him.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.110
Wow! What's this?

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:42.990
This seems pretty fast. But if I improve the transmission, it'll be even faster.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:52.750
What are you doing?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:01.680
Sorry. I was remodeling it so that it would be faster.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.600
And I changed the color.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.140
Blue's pretty good too.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.440
It's the color of your image.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:13.480
Thanks.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:18.440
By the way, you've been following me since this morning. Do you want something from me?

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:25.780
Everyone bullies me because I'm only good at mechanics.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:31.710
But I saw you running and wanted to be cool, just like you!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:33.750
Do you think that's possible?

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.710
What's your name?

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:39.920
Miles Prower. But everyone calls me Tails.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:45.220
I'm Sonic. Tails, I'll leave this in your hands, so do what you like with it.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.930
You don't mind?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.140
No problem.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.190
I was the same in the past.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:58.320
I thought I couldn't do anything either.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.200
But I changed after meeting Sonic.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.410
I decided to try my best.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.240
What I can do right now is...

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.840
Please stop the construction!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.680
You sure are pushy. I already said no.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.180
Go home!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:33.270
If you continue, the animals will no longer be able to live here.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:37.860
Please stop making this dam right now!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:41.690
Tails!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:49.490
If you continue to interfere with our construction, we'll take you to court.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.920
That would be bad. Let's think of another way, Tails.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.920
Another way?

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:04.800
Everyone.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:12.350
Everyone, please listen!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:16.520
Do you know that they're building a dam in the savannah?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.900
What? Building a dam? No, not at all.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:23.400
What's the meaning of this!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.570
There's no need for a dam in a place like this!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:32.490
Our goal is that in the event of a landslide, the dam can stop it.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.660
Landslides do not occur in a savannah!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.080
Well, umm...

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.260
Damn them!

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.800
Stop the construction immediately!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:54.310
Everyone, we understand. However, let us build the dam for now. If you want to destroy it after we build it, then go ahead.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.350
Then there's no point in building it to begin with!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.560
True.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:13:59.730
We did it!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.360
We went through a lot of trouble to build this dam.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.280
If we stop now, we won't make any profit.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:14.830
But partner, what are you planning to do with the gasoline?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:21.210
Can't you tell? If we set the jungle on fire, the smoke will cause clouds to form in the sky.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:28.550
If clouds form, it will rain. The rain will flood the savannah, turning it into a lake.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:36.480
Even those who don't want a dam built in a savannah will agree to have one at a lake.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.060
I see. You thought things out, partner.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.950
What is that?

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:53.660
Is it the guardian spirit of the jungle? Please forgive us!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.160
They're completely wrong.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.420
Sonic is a blue hedgehog.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.670
Like that one.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.710
That's Sonic!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.590
E-65, smash him!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.010
That's why I said we shouldn't do this!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.350
I don't want to either!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.690
That's Eggman's robot.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.280
Eggman's robot, I'm over here!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.170
Who were they?

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.010
I don't know. But now's our chance.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.940
What a slowpoke.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.480
You're no match for me at all.

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.200
Where did you come from?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.380
This place will do. Let's finish this quickly.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.090
Right, partner.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.300
You minor characters!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.100
Did you see a blue hedgehog around here somewhere?

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.930
It's another weirdo.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:44.020
Did you call me a weirdo?

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:49.360
You called Dr. Eggman, the genius of this century, a weird geezer!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.230
I won't forgive you!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.700
Save us!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.740
I picked on them.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.210
They seemed like the bad guys.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.460
He's this way!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:15.300
That robot camouflages itself with the jungle. I don't see him at all.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.230
Dammit...

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.310
Serves you right, Sonic.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.230
Eggman!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.150
I'm here for payback!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.250
Finish him off, E-65.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:44.580
We'll see about that.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.480
There!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.900
Running away, Sonic? You coward!

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.240
If you don't like it, come and get me!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:23.080
E-65, chase after Sonic!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.250
That jungle is full of monsters!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.210
Calm down!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.340
What's going on?

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:48.730
Everyone, we have to leave.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.560
It's time to say goodbye.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.280
Let's go look for Sonic.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.490
Sonic!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.370
Hey, Sonic!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.710
Hey, Chris and Tails.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.920
Have you been doing well?

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:13.920
Same to you, Sonic. We were worried about you.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.510
We won't let you escape, Sonic!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:19.670
Eggman's robot?

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.800
I'll take care of this quick, so wait up.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.510
Stop!

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:37.190
You hide your head, but you don't hide your butt.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:45.530
Oh no! E-65 can camouflage itself with nature, but it can't with artificial objects!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.630
Who would put these unnecessary objects here?

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.380
Take this! And this! And this!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.010
This is what happens to things that get in my way.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.430
Take that!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:14.520
All the money we spent to buy those machines...

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.320
I can't take much more of this...

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.280
Let's get out of here!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:33.290
Let's flee!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.250
Sonic, catch!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.800
It's time to end this.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.060
Take this!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.160
E-65!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.320
He did it! Yay!

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:15.330
How dare you, Sonic! I'll take you on personally!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.500
Bring it on, Eggman!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.130
Here I go!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.090
Bring it!

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:30.260
Dr. Eggman!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.310
I have a message for you from Dr. Eggman.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.820
Listen very carefully.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:46.200
You won't get away with this next time, Sonic!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:52.160
This robot will now automatically start tap dancing.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:06.630
I can't dance well! I'm going home!

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.970
How frustrating!

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.390
You're under arrest for attempted arson.

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:17.020
Okay.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:18.980
Case closed.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:26.440
When you think about it, Eggman also helped stop the illegal building of the dam.

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:27.610
You're right.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.840 --> 00:25:35.360
The Ghost of the Old Castle, King Boom Boo
